("MediSync is an enterprise healthcare platform that solves prescription tampering and dispensary fraud using Public Key) Tj
T* (Infrastructure \(PKI\). Whenever a physician prescribes medication, the payload is hashed with SHA-256 and digitally signed) Tj
T* (with their RSA-2048 private key. Pharmacies mathematically verify the hash against the doctor's public key before) Tj
T* (dispensing medications. It features 5 role-based portals \(Doctor, Pharmacy, Hospital, Patient, Admin\), full dark/light clinical) Tj
T* (themes, and an offline-resilient client mock engine.") Tj
