(Prescription data \(patientId, medicines, diagnosis, expiryDate\) is serialized and hashed with SHA-256. The hash is encrypted with) Tj
T* (the doctor's RSA-2048 private key. The pharmacy decrypts the signature using the public key and compares it to the recomputed) Tj
T* (hash. If even a single character was altered, the check fails.) Tj
ET
