40. 717.3899999999999864 Td
(Deploying to static hosts like GitHub Pages causes /api/* endpoints to 404 because no Node server runs on the static CDN.) Tj
T* (MediSync resolves this using an Axios adapter in api.js: when running on GitHub Pages or if the backend is down, it seamlessly) Tj
T* (routes requests to clientMockDb.js, which manages localStorage state with full CRUD parity.) Tj
ET
